  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5R6Vc7i.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/clear-weather\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-0C0D0F?logo=discord&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p>🌧️ <strong>Clear Weather</strong> 是一個極簡風格的資源包，它降低了《Minecraft》中雨和雪的粒子效果，帶來更乾淨、更節省頻寬的體驗。無論您是正在錄製內容，還是只是厭倦了視覺上的雜亂，這個資源包都能幫助您在暴風雨中保持畫面清晰——同時不會移除環境氛圍。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 功能特點</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>減少雨雪粒子</strong> – 在惡劣天氣下呈現更乾淨的視覺效果。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>適合直播主</strong> – 有助於避免因粒子效果過多而導致的頻寬問題。</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>輕量級</strong> - 不會增加紋理解析度，因此不會影響效能</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>高度相容</strong> - 可與其他資源包搭配使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🖼️ 預覽</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogdgDEj.gif\" width=\"400\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z9slA5O.gif\" width=\"400\">\n<h2>💬 需要支援？</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/clear-weather/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>Github</code></a> 或 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>Discord 伺服器</code></a>！</p>",
